<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>ATOMIC</Major>
    <Description>This is a macro to obtain free coins on the mu online server.

When you move from one map to another, 
You earn totally free coins.

Every 5 seconds
Which is how long it takes, you earn coins Free.

Time may vary depending on the server. 


let them enjoy it</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 88 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyUp 88 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyDown 82 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyUp 82 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyDown 82 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyUp 82 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyDown 88 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyUp 88 1
Delay 200 ms
Delay 3 s</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>MU Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>